{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3941ba2b-c8e2-8fe8-8b42-e24280ae26e9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T10:33:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. I need a copy of a birth certificate. I'm not close by right now, so I'm wondering how I request one by mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is the birth certificate for someone born here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Born at the hospital here. It's mine, I lost the old one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. For mail requests you fill out an application form, include a copy of your photo ID, and send it in with the payment. You can get the form off the city website, or I can mail one to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll grab it off the website. How long does it take once I send it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually about a week or so once we get it, plus the time in the mail. Right after a storm like this past weekend, the mail can run a little slow, so maybe give it a few extra days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that nor'easter Saturday into Sunday made a mess of everything. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does. Was there anything else on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. What ID do I bring? Or send. Actually, if I come in, what do I bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you come in, bring a current government photo ID. A driver's license, a state ID, or a passport all work. If your name has changed since birth, bring something that shows that too, like a marriage certificate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:31:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No name change. Just the license. It's got my current address, that's fine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Make sure it's not expired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. [pause] I'm calling from the road, actually. I'm on my way back toward Newport. Funny thing, I once drove this whole route the opposite way by mistake. Ended up forty minutes the wrong direction before I noticed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Well, hopefully you've got the right direction today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, this time I do. So if I'm already coming in, I could just do it in person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely. We're open today until the end of the afternoon. Come to the clerk's office at City Hall, bring your license, and fill out the form here. In person we can usually take care of it while you wait, or very quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I change my mind and mail it instead, same form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same form, and a photocopy of the front of your license in the envelope. Address it to the City Clerk at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. License copy, form, mail to the clerk. Or just come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Do you want me to take a callback number in case anything comes up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0189. Zelia Rocha."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zelia Rocha, 401-555-0189. Got it. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "De nada. Drive safe, and we'll see you later."
    }
  ],
